{"pageid":3659,"title":"Red Keycard","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Red Keycard</span>","revid":16644,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The Red Keycard or Observatory Keycard is a Item bought at the <a href=\"/wiki/Gizmo%27s_Observatory\" title=\"Gizmo&#39;s Observatory\">Observatory</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowlands\">Snowlands</a>. It is used to get passage between <a href=\"/wiki/Snowdrift_Station_A_%26_B\" title=\"Snowdrift Station A &amp; B\">Snowdrift Station's</a> without paying the $2,500 fee. It costs $50,000 from the <a href=\"/wiki/Gizmo%27s_Observatory\" title=\"Gizmo&#39;s Observatory\">Observatory</a> on the second floor which requires a <a href=\"/wiki/Lab_Card\" title=\"Lab Card\">Lab Card</a> to gain access to. The Key card can be equipped (\"covering\" the Scuba Tank but in its own slot still) similar to the <a href=\"/wiki/Lab_Card\" title=\"Lab Card\">Lab Card</a>.\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Red Keycard</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dc/Observatory_Card.png/revision/latest?cb=20241208195007\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Observatory Card\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dc/Observatory_Card.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241208195007\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dc/Observatory_Card.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241208195007 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dc/Observatory_Card.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241208195007 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"O